  "latex": "\\begin{vmatrix}0&\\cdots&0&a_{1n}\\\\0&\\cdots&a_{2,n-1}&0\\\\\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots&\\vdots\\\\a_{n1}&\\cdots&0&0\\end{vmatrix}=(-1)^{\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}}a_{1n}a_{2,n-1}\\cdots a_{n1}",
  "summary": "仅次对角线上元素非零的行列式，其值等于次对角元素之积乘以符号 (−1)^(n(n−1)/2)。",
  "conditions": "除次对角线外元素全为零。",
